stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> incomplete
    incomplete --> missing-note : compose [no linked note]
    incomplete --> missing-source : compose [note exists, no source refs]
    incomplete --> evidence-pending : compose [sources linked, excerpt or anchor missing]
    incomplete --> supported : compose [note + sources complete]
    missing-note --> supported : link note
    missing-source --> supported : link sources
    evidence-pending --> supported : fill excerpt and anchor
    supported --> incomplete : remove note or source